            "id": 82632,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>new_users</code> içindeki değerleri <code>users_list</code> içinde ayrı öğeler olarak depoladık. <code>print(users_list)</code> kodunu yazarak bunları görüntüleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_users = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann Jon Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users_list = new_users.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ann', 'Jon', 'Alex']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>users_list</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
