            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizeler varsayılan olarak boşluk karakterlerine göre ayrılır. <code>print(words_list),</code> kodunu yazarsak ayrılmış listede dört değer görürüz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"words = \" /><text value=\"&quot;gear fault lights build-up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"words_list = words.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(words_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['gear', 'fault', 'lights', 'build-up']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>words_list</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
